://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/shoreline_deer_1.png\" alt=\"shoreline_deer_1\" /></p>\n<h4>Lighthouse</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_weed_0.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_weed_0\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_weed_1.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_weed_1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_champagne.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_champagne\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_monalisa.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_monalisa\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_valuable_0.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_valuable_0\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_valuable_1.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_valuable_1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_military_0.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_military_0\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/refs/heads/main/images/lighthouse_military_1.png\" alt=\"lighthouse_military_1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheYellowDoge/YellowDoge-TarkovRareCollectibles/r